        <div class="section">
            <h2>3. Price Spread & Market Competitiveness</h2>
            <p>The price spread analysis is critical for assessing market competitiveness. A large spread indicates that consumers may face significant price disparities depending on which station they visit. The Interquartile Range (IQR) shows the typical price band most consumers encounter.</p>

            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th>Fuel Type</th>
                    <th>Mean Price</th>
                    <th>Median Price</th>
                    <th>IQR (Q3-Q1)</th>
